82 and is the most successful team in the country. In its initial days, the club was known as Petroclube . Four players from Petro Atlético represented Angola at their first World Cup in 2006 : Lebo Lebo , Lamá , Zé Kalanga and Delgado . The club has also a basketball team. Many basketball players of the team, participated with Angola national basketball team in the Olympics 2008 . Honours [ edit ] Girabola : 20 1982 , 1984 , 1986 , 1987 , 1988 , 1989 , 1990 , 1993 , 1994 , 1995 , 1997 , 2000 , 2001 , 2008 , 2009 , 2021–22 , 2022–23 , 2023–24 , 2024–25, 2025–26 Angola Cup : 15 1987, 1992, 1993, 1994, 1997, 1998, 2000, 2002 , 2012 , 2013 , 2017 , 2020–21 , 2021–22 , 2022–23 , 2023–24 Angola Super Cup : 6 1987, 1988, 1993, 1994, 2002 , 2013 
